507
00:31:04.760 --> 00:31:05.880
It wasn't her.

508
00:31:05.960 --> 00:31:08.320
Because we have another match.

509
00:31:09.720 --> 00:31:13.360
[program ticking]

510
00:31:13.440 --> 00:31:15.800
[tense music playing]

511
00:31:17.600 --> 00:31:18.440
