I told him to come over
so you two can meet him.

521
00:32:02.840 --> 00:32:03.840
No. I'll go.

522
00:32:04.480 --> 00:32:05.480
Okay.

523
00:32:17.200 --> 00:32:18.720
Can we talk for a minute?

524
00:32:31.800 --> 00:32:32.800
