Aranda tipped me off.
but he won't confess to the police.

573
00:36:16.600 --> 00:36:18.280
Drop me at Jaime's and go.

574
00:36:19.080 --> 00:36:20.080
Are you sure?

575
00:36:23.560 --> 00:36:24.560
[glove box slams]

576
