Now you want to pin
SĂ¡ez and Gallardo's murders on me.

600
00:37:54.080 --> 00:37:56.240
- What's he have to do with that?
- I don't know.

601
00:37:56.320 --> 00:37:58.560
But I swear I'm not leaving here
